                <pb facs="0112" n="84" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v04/pg84"/>

                <head>31. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>At the 285th meeting of the National Security Council on May 17, the President,
                    Secretary Wilson, Governor Stassen, and Admiral Radford discussed the outmoded
                    character of current NATO planning and current NATO force levels in terms of
                    nuclear warfare. The memorandum of discussion at the meeting is is scheduled for
                    publication in the compilation on national security policy in a forthcoming
                    volume of <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>.</p>
            </div>
